(a) pilot with 12 schools, 6 treated
  observed difference = 3.998 points; 924 possible assignments
  exact randomisation p = 0.1061; Welch t-test p = 0.1136
  smallest attainable p-value = 0.0022
(b) pupil-level trial, n = 160
  difference in means = 5.043
  Monte Carlo randomisation p (9999 draws) = 0.0010; Welch p = 0.0009
  95% Fisher interval for a constant effect: [2.15, 8.00]
